Development-only tool that validates a G98 firmware-update.bin and stages it
with a SHA-256-verified one-shot request on the EFI System Partition. The next
G98 U-Boot verifies the image, updates SPI NOR without overwriting its saved
environment, verifies the flash contents, and resets.

Power loss during the SPI write still requires Maskrom recovery. This port is
intentionally not included in RK3588 installer or production images.
